From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arvind Oruganti <aoruganti@microsoft.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 00:37:10 +0530
Subject: Fix ICU 78 CodeQL format/comparison warnings in remaining test files

Completes the CodeQL cleanup for the ba289-touched files (pre-existing upstream
test/tool debt): format-specifier width fixes and one comparison-with-wider-type
fix across utf16tst.c, udatatst.c, tstnorm.cpp, numfmtst.cpp, rbbitst.cpp,
regextst.cpp, ustrtest.cpp, and tools/makeconv/genmbcs.cpp. Recorded as a patch
so a future ICU upstream import does not revert them.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

